          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8082",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "ws"
          ]
        },
        "description": "WebSocket endpoint for real-time chat, presence, and typing indicators. Requires a valid JWT in the Authorization header (or query param 'token').\n\n### Sample Frames:\n\n#### 1. Send Message (JSON)\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"msg_123\",\n  \"sender_phone\": \"{{phone_1}}\",\n  \"recipient_phones\": [\"{{phone_2}}\"],\n  \"conversation_id\": \"{{conversation_id}}\",\n  \"body\": \"Hello via WebSocket!\",\n  \"group_message\": false\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. Presence Update (Received)\n```json\n{\n  \"user_phone\": \"{{phone_2}}\",\n  \"status\": \"online\",\n  \"last_seen\": \"2023-10-27T10:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n#### 3. Typing Indicator (Send/Receive)\n```json\n{\n  \"user_phone\": \"{{phone_1}}\",\n  \"conversation_id\": \"{{conversation_id}}\",\n  \"typing\": true\n}\n```"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Example: Chat Message Frame",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://localhost:8082/api/v1/ws",
              "protocol": "ws"
            }
          },
          "body": "{\n  \"message_id\": \"msg_789\",\n  \"sender_phone\": \"+919000000001\",\n  \"recipient_phones\": [\"+919000000002\"],\n  \"conversation_id\": \"dm:+919000000001:+919000000002\",\n  \"body\": \"Hey there!\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2023-10-27T10:05:00Z\",\n  \"group_message\": false\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Example: Presence Update",
          "body": "{\n  \"user_phone\": \"+919000000002\",\n  \"status\": \"online\",\n  \"last_seen\": \"2023-10-27T10:10:00Z\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    }
